            <ArticleTitle>Dual visualization: a technique to simplify native vessel intervention in patients with bypass grafts.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e10-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.ijcard.2009.01.006</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of stenting to a distal left anterior descending artery stenosis via the native vessel aided by contrast injection via a left internal mammary artery graft. This dual visualization technique allows good distal vessel opacification whilst minimising instrumentation of the internal mammary artery and its associated risks.</AbstractText>
